message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Can an LLM edit a neural audio codec for one song? Weight-space pruning and patching of a SAGE decoder"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rukin"
    given-names: "Artem"
    alias: "FastAnt"
year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/FastAnt/sage-decoder-research"
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  We study whether GPT-6 Astra can structurally prune the SAGE neural audio codec decoder for a
  single track and repair the resulting quality loss with a small shippable weight delta.
